    </valueSet>
    <!--
      UNRESTRICTED, and that is a deliberate exception to the project default of restricted.

      Restricted picklists on this project ARE enforced at DML, measured four separate
      times. FSD 5.10.3 says charge components appear irregularly, so a monthly bill import
      carrying a component name that is not on the list would HARD FAIL the row under a
      restricted picklist. The failure mode of unrestricted is a typo in a report grouping;
      the failure mode of restricted is a rejected bill. The first is recoverable.

      The ten seeded values are taken from the FSD 5.10.2 examples only: energy, pass
      through and taxes for electricity, and surface water, wastewater, stormwater, grease
      trap and fire for water, plus Base Charge and Other.
    -->
</CustomField>
